body:
@junit-team/junit-lambda This is technically the first candidate issue for a 5.0.1 release.

Though perhaps we should wait to see how many other bugs are reported in the coming weeks/months before deciding to put out a point release.

Thoughts?

FYI: I simplified the provided test case to demonstrate that the bug is neither related to Maven nor specifically to `@EnableRuleMigrationSupport`.

```java
@ExtendWith(ExpectedExceptionSupport.class)
class ExpectedExceptionSupportTestCase {

	@Test
	void shouldFail() {
		fail("must fail");
	}

}
```
